{"3783170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Realm of Illusion", "steam_appid": 3783170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realm of Illusion is an action Rogue game, featuring a wide variety of skill combinations and synergies, along with thrilling hack-and-slash combat. While it includes action elements, players who cleverly combine their skills can also achieve overwhelming power and effortlessly defeat their enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlike most action Rogue games, which often predefine the entire skill set or combat style through character or weapon choice and only allow minor passive enhancements later, <i>Realm of Illusion</i> takes a different approach.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Realm of Illusion</strong></i>, skills, weapons, and characters are independent. Players can freely combine <strong>characters + weapons + active skills + passive skills</strong> to create unique playstyles. The entire active skill set must be assembled during gameplay, with a maximum of <strong>6 active skills, 6 passive skills, and 4 pieces of equipment</strong> equipped at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As skills cannot be stacked infinitely, players must constantly make choices and adjustments—discarding redundant abilities in favor of better ones—to achieve more effective synergies and unlock even greater combo effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/519be50efc3a47393f3c8b9b733fdc39.poster.avif?t=1758698823\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/519be50efc3a47393f3c8b9b733fdc39.webm?t=1758698823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/519be50efc3a47393f3c8b9b733fdc39.mp4?t=1758698823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/38b25f9996d5121c7cd783bbed19f819.poster.avif?t=1758698823\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/38b25f9996d5121c7cd783bbed19f819.webm?t=1758698823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/38b25f9996d5121c7cd783bbed19f819.mp4?t=1758698823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features many distinct playstyles, such as summoning, lifesteal, and auto-casting builds. Due to limited space, not all can be showcased here — players are encouraged to experiment and create their own unique combinations in-game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can build their skill playstyles through chests and merchants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/4ddf7c383febf829e0b6741248412c6e.avif?t=1758698823\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters — The game currently features 6 unlockable characters. Players can earn points through challenges to unlock them, and each character comes with unique and powerful starting abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/f6faa864b5c438ede09d40cb20e223c8.avif?t=1758698823\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta Progression — Points earned during challenges can be used in the hub to permanently enhance your characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/d930e2fcf3b09c543c52f22f21dd1d1b.avif?t=1758698823\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion System — During stages, players can recruit different NPCs to join their party</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/a9c62f44862895e94ae410b6fb8b9794.avif?t=1758698823\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realm of Illusion is an action Rogue game, featuring a wide variety of skill combinations and synergies, along with thrilling hack-and-slash combat. While it includes action elements, players who cleverly combine their skills can also achieve overwhelming power and effortlessly defeat their enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlike most action Rogue games, which often predefine the entire skill set or combat style through character or weapon choice and only allow minor passive enhancements later, <i>Realm of Illusion</i> takes a different approach.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Realm of Illusion</strong></i>, skills, weapons, and characters are independent. Players can freely combine <strong>characters + weapons + active skills + passive skills</strong> to create unique playstyles. The entire active skill set must be assembled during gameplay, with a maximum of <strong>6 active skills, 6 passive skills, and 4 pieces of equipment</strong> equipped at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As skills cannot be stacked infinitely, players must constantly make choices and adjustments—discarding redundant abilities in favor of better ones—to achieve more effective synergies and unlock even greater combo effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/519be50efc3a47393f3c8b9b733fdc39.poster.avif?t=1758698823\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/519be50efc3a47393f3c8b9b733fdc39.webm?t=1758698823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/519be50efc3a47393f3c8b9b733fdc39.mp4?t=1758698823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/38b25f9996d5121c7cd783bbed19f819.poster.avif?t=1758698823\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/38b25f9996d5121c7cd783bbed19f819.webm?t=1758698823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/38b25f9996d5121c7cd783bbed19f819.mp4?t=1758698823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features many distinct playstyles, such as summoning, lifesteal, and auto-casting builds. Due to limited space, not all can be showcased here — players are encouraged to experiment and create their own unique combinations in-game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can build their skill playstyles through chests and merchants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/4ddf7c383febf829e0b6741248412c6e.avif?t=1758698823\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters — The game currently features 6 unlockable characters. Players can earn points through challenges to unlock them, and each character comes with unique and powerful starting abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/f6faa864b5c438ede09d40cb20e223c8.avif?t=1758698823\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta Progression — Points earned during challenges can be used in the hub to permanently enhance your characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/d930e2fcf3b09c543c52f22f21dd1d1b.avif?t=1758698823\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companion System — During stages, players can recruit different NPCs to join their party</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783170/extras/a9c62f44862895e94ae410b6fb8b9794.avif?t=1758698823\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Realm of Illusion is an action rogue game featuring diverse skill combinations and synergies, delivering exhilarating hack-and-slash combat. With hundreds of collectible skills, over a dozen weapons, and a variety of build paths", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese<strong>*</strong>,